Changes made to the original data (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)): the datasets were joined
by USUBJID into two files, only the columns named in make-fixture.R were kept, and
the files were exported as CSV. No value was altered. The package's AVAL and CNSR
columns were left out because for the arm-C rows they repeat arm A's values and
disagree with the TIME and EVENT columns that the package's own analyses read.

The data are simulated; they describe no real patient. They are used by the test
case N34 of vcr-engine only, as the reference against which the engine's
time-to-event MAIC is compared: the engine does not install, import or call maicplus.
